            "pos": "noun",
            "senses": [
                {
                    "sense_id": "97a64802-cb03-3280-84bb-cebb835aea5f",
                    "sense_definition": "An animal that has a backbone or spinal column, such as mammals, birds, reptiles, amphibians, and fish.",
